ulevard and Homestead Road\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E35\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003C\/tbody\u003E\u003C\/table\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"52f854ba-9ef9-498a-8613-68ceaafd0c47","prev_id":null}]}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/b2ae45bc-d789-46ef-b6e3-9585e3b3e029","ref":{"parent":"ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":1,"tag":"h3"},"pos":"212-17","docId":"75","text":"CHAPTER 11.20: STOP SIGNS*","id":"b2ae45bc-d789-46ef-b6e3-9585e3b3e029","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/b2ae45bc-d789-46ef-b6e3-9585e3b3e029\/c6b29785-d684-497c-bae5-2d160d9cca23","ref":{"parent":"b2ae45bc-d789-46ef-b6e3-9585e3b3e029","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-17-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003E* For statutory provisions authorizing local authorities to place and maintain traffic-control devices as required by statute or as necessary to implement statutes or local ordinances, see Veh. Code \u00a7 21351; for provisions generally regarding traffic signs, signals, and markings, see Veh. Code \u00a7 21350 et seq.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"c6b29785-d684-497c-bae5-2d160d9cca23","prev_id":null},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/b2ae45bc-d789-46ef-b6e3-9585e3b3e029\/7aca5d42-8d84-47fc-932e-4f40586122db","ref":{"parent":"b2ae45bc-d789-46ef-b6e3-9585e3b3e029","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-17-12","docId":"75","text":"11.20.010 Purpose.","id":"7aca5d42-8d84-47fc-932e-4f40586122db","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/b2ae45bc-d789-46ef-b6e3-9585e3b3e029\/7aca5d42-8d84-47fc-932e-4f40586122db\/30bedd3d-1f18-46e3-a32c-0f25b9bb46f8","ref":{"parent":"7aca5d42-8d84-47fc-932e-4f40586122db","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-17-12-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EIt is the express purpose of the ordinance codified in this chapter to consolidate in one ordinance all presently or heretofore designated stop intersections where stops are required at certain approaches thereto as hereinafter defined and to provide a means for incorporating all the stop intersections that may hereafter be so designated or declared.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 467, \u00a7 1, 1970)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"30bedd3d-1f18-46e3-a32c-0f25b9bb46f8","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/b2ae45bc-d789-46ef-b6e3-9585e3b3e029\/1611e4d8-684d-45d7-b69a-65127e9d000f","ref":{"parent":"b2ae45bc-d789-46ef-b6e3-9585e3b3e029","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-17-13","docId":"75","text":"11.20.020 Vehicular Stop Required at Certain Intersections.","id":"1611e4d8-684d-45d7-b69a-65127e9d000f","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/b2ae45bc-d789-46ef-b6e3-9585e3b3e029\/1611e4d8-684d-45d7-b69a-65127e9d000f\/e15c9fdd-fe25-4b2e-8608-cadf24fe880e","ref":{"parent":"1611e4d8-684d-45d7-b69a-65127e9d000f","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-17-13-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Col class=\u0022default-style\u0022 style=\u0022list-style-type:upper-alpha\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe driver of any vehicle upon approaching the entrance of any of the following intersections sign-posted with a stop sign shall stop:\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAt a limit line, if marked, otherwise before entering the crosswalk on the near side of the intersection, or, if not marked, then before entering the intersection; or,\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAt any point within the intersection as required by a stop sign.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ol\u003E\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfter such stop, the driver shall yield the right-of-way to other vehicles on that part of any street protected by any stop sign which are so close as to constitute an immediate hazard, and shall continue to yield the right-of-way to such approaching vehicles until such time as he can proceed with reasonable safety. A driver having yielded may proceed, and the drivers of all other vehicles approaching on that part of the street protected by the stop sign shall yield the right-of-way to the vehicle about to enter or cross the protected part of the street:\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ol\u003E\u003Ctable cellpadding=\u00220\u0022 cellspacing=\u00220\u0022 style=\u0022width:600px\u0022\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\u0022col\u0022 style=\u0022vertical-align:top; white-space:nowrap\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EApproaching Streets Required to Stop\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\u0022col\u0022 style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAt Any Entrance Thereof With:\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/th\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003C\/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAinsworth Drive\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHartman Drive\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAmulet Drive\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECastine Avenue\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAnn Arbor Avenue\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGreenleaf Drive\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EApple Tree Lane\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EVista Drive\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u00