:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELiberty Oak Lane\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENorth Oak Square\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELong Oak Lane\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENorthpoint Way\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELongdown Road\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENorthridge Square\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMossy Oak Court\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENorthseal Square\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENorthshore Square\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPotters Hatch Common\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENorthsky Square\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ERidgeway Drive\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENorthview Square\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESpanish Oak Court\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENorthwest Square\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESurrey Circle\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENorthwind Square\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESwan Oak Lane\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPoplar Grove Square\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/td\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003C\/tbody\u003E\u003C\/table\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 831, \u00a7 5.2, 1977)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"ee6b6d1c-f373-48be-97bb-b2d2b81d49f2","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f5669e6a-1ff3-4b85-99f5-ddcdd7865570\/73faebd9-09ae-491c-9f88-630c031334ec","ref":{"parent":"f5669e6a-1ff3-4b85-99f5-ddcdd7865570","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-19-214","docId":"75","text":"11.26.130 Violation\u2013Penalty.","id":"73faebd9-09ae-491c-9f88-630c031334ec","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f5669e6a-1ff3-4b85-99f5-ddcdd7865570\/73faebd9-09ae-491c-9f88-630c031334ec\/be8abfdf-2550-475d-bab7-fdefa6471b1d","ref":{"parent":"73faebd9-09ae-491c-9f88-630c031334ec","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-19-214-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EAny person who violates the provisions of this chapter shall be guilty of an infraction and upon conviction thereof shall be punished as provided in Chapter 1.12.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 1179, \u00a7 2 (part), 1982; Ord. 831, \u00a7 6.1, 1977)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"be8abfdf-2550-475d-bab7-fdefa6471b1d","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f5669e6a-1ff3-4b85-99f5-ddcdd7865570\/1a80cb9a-10b6-40a7-b24c-d8c4ef64b4fc","ref":{"parent":"f5669e6a-1ff3-4b85-99f5-ddcdd7865570","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-19-215","docId":"75","text":"11.26.140 Specification of Sign Permitting Removal Of Vehicles.","id":"1a80cb9a-10b6-40a7-b24c-d8c4ef64b4fc","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f5669e6a-1ff3-4b85-99f5-ddcdd7865570\/1a80cb9a-10b6-40a7-b24c-d8c4ef64b4fc\/3dd32017-049a-4f77-aaf9-73cc1afd2c78","ref":{"parent":"1a80cb9a-10b6-40a7-b24c-d8c4ef64b4fc","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-19-215-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EThis sign to be used on private property authorizing the owner or person in lawful possession to remove vehicles from private property shall be eighteen inches wide and twenty-four inches high. The sign shall contain the words \u0022Private Property\u0022 in two and one-half inch high letters, the telephone number of the law enforcement agency in one and one-half inch high letters and \u0022C.V.C. 22658\u0022 in one inch high letters and shall substantially conform to Exhibit 11.26.140.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 1313, 1985)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEXHIBIT 11.26.140\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt=\u0022\u0022 height=\u0022697\u0022 src=\u0022https:\/\/codehub.gridics.com\/..\/files\/codehub_files\/75_5916\/Picture5.png\u0022 width=\u0022600\u0022\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"3dd32017-049a-4f77-aaf9-73cc1afd2c78","prev_id":null}]}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","ref":{"parent":"ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":1,"tag":"h3"},"pos":"212-210","docId":"75","text":"CHAPTER 11.27: PERMIT PARKING ZONE","id":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/d56e4d79-bcf5-4d03-b6f8-2a91f76ec901","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"d56e4d79-bcf5-4d03-b6f8-2a91f76ec901","prev_id":null},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/d59aeb05-1a37-4390-94d3-ead848e3ac33","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-12","docId":"75","text":"11.27.010 Permit Parking Zone Established.","id":"d59aeb05-1a37-4390-94d3-ead848e3ac33","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/d59aeb05-1a37-4390-94d3-ead848e3ac33\/d89961b4-c477-48ab-9c73-229909a64c36","ref":{"parent":"d59aeb05-1a37-4390-94d3-ead848e3ac33","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-12-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EUnder the provisions of Section 22507 of the Vehicle Code, the City Council does ordain that a preferential parking zone be established in Cupertino in which parking will be prohibited as established by ordinance of the City Council. Exemptions from such prohibition, when not otherwise indicated, will be by securing and displaying in a vehicle a type of parking permit described in this chapter.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 1731, (part), 1996; Ord. 1197, (part), 1982)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"d89961b4-c477-48ab-9c73-229909a64c36","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/c5b7b46a-5276-4495-8be1-27c90cfde933","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-13","docId":"75","text":"11.27.020 Definitions.","id":"c5b7b46a-5276-4495-8be1-27c90cfde933","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/c5b7b46a-5276-4495-8be1-27c90cfde933\/d002ee09-5152-4631-b526-6a9f4818e4f9","ref":{"parent":"c5b7b46a-5276-4495-8be1-27c90cfde933","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-13-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EWhenever the following terms are used in this chapter, they shall be deemed and construed to have the following meaning:\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Col class=\u0022default-style\u0022 style=\u0022list-style-type:upper-alpha\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u0022Commercial and industrial properties\u0022 means a business enterprise operated within the permit parking zone.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u0022Designated groups\u0022 means members of organizations, professions, or other class of individuals as determined by City Council that the use of the permits will not adversely affect parking conditions for residents and merchants in the area.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u0022Guest of resident\u0022 means bona fide visitors to a residence located in the permit parking zone.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u0022Motor vehicle\u0022 means and includes any device by which any person or property may be propelled, moved or drawn upon a highway. For the purposes of this chapter, a motor vehicle shall include licensed automobile, trucks as defined in Section 11.28.010G, recreational vehicle,motorcycle or other motor-drawn or drawn form of transportation weighing over fifty pounds.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u0022Resident\u0022 means the principal occupant of a single-family dwelling or of a legal housing unit of a condominium or multiple family dwelling. The quarters occupied are called a \u0022residence\u0022 or a \u0022household.\u0022 (Ord. 14-2118, (part), 2014; Ord. 1197, (part), 1982)\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"d002ee09-5152-4631-b526-6a9f4818e4f9","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/187a4bdc-0a53-49cc-80ac-0638b0b66f3e","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-14","docId":"75","text":"11.27.030 Permit Parking Zone Description.","id":"187a4bdc-0a53-49cc-80ac-0638b0b66f3e","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/187a4bdc-0a53-49cc-80ac-0638b0b66f3e\/022ea6b9-e8aa-4bad-9d1c-cbbecf75cd78","ref":{"parent":"187a4bdc-0a53-49cc-80ac-0638b0b66f3e","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-14-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EThe permit parking zone shall be the designated areas in which no person shall stop, stand or park any vehicle, except for vehicles which display a valid parking permit.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 1197, (part), 1982)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"022ea6b9-e8aa-4bad-9d1c-cbbecf75cd78","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/e3471ee5-d78e-475c-9314-e49e2505052e","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-15","docId":"75","text":"11.27.040 Posting of Permit Parking Zone.","id":"e3471ee5-d78e-475c-9314-e49e2505052e","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/e3471ee5-d78e-475c-9314-e49e2505052e\/036b5db3-d4f9-44a6-b04c-0bf2d57bdad1","ref":{"parent":"e3471ee5-d78e-475c-9314-e49e2505052e","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-15-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EThe Director of Public Works shall cause appropriate signs to be erected inside or outside the permit parking zone indicating prominently thereon the conditions under which the permit parking regulations shall be enforced.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 1197, (part), 1982)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"036b5db3-d4f9-44a6-b04c-0bf2d57bdad1","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/17d8b2ca-ffc5-4f98-994b-7b7f049951bd","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-16","docId":"75","text":"11.27.050 Issuance of permits to residents and members of designated groups.","id":"17d8b2ca-ffc5-4f98-994b-7b7f049951bd","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/17d8b2ca-ffc5-4f98-994b-7b7f049951bd\/fbe04f86-7c1c-44d6-b29e-c37eb6022857","ref":{"parent":"17d8b2ca-ffc5-4f98-994b-7b7f049951bd","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-16-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Col class=\u0022default-style\u0022 style=\u0022list-style-type:upper-alpha\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003EResidents and members of designated groups parking permits shall be issued by the Director of Public Works. No more than one parking permit shall be issued to each motor vehicle for which application is made. The Director of Public Works is authorized to issue such rules and regulations, consistent with this chapter, governing the manner in which residents shall qualify for parking permits.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EResidents, as defined in Section 11.28.020, may apply for and receive up to twenty (20) parking permits per household, annually, to park their oversized vehicle, as defined in Section 11.28.010. Residents can obtain these permits from the City. Resident parking permits will be valid for seventy-two (72) hours only, and must be displayed visibly on the dashboard of the authorized vehicle. Any permitted oversized vehicle must be moved a minimum of fifteen hundred (1500) feet after the expiration of the permit, and may not repark within fifteen hundred (1500) feet of the original space for the following seventy-two (72) hours, even with a new parking permit.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 14-2118, (part), 2014; Ord. 1197, (part), 1982; Ord. 25-2275, \u00a7 1, 2025)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"fbe04f86-7c1c-44d6-b29e-c37eb6022857","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/4eb3f28b-8e2f-4329-996e-597875a05436","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-17","docId":"75","text":"11.27.060 Issuance of Permits to Guests of Residents.","id":"4eb3f28b-8e2f-4329-996e-597875a05436","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/4eb3f28b-8e2f-4329-996e-597875a05436\/b1bc0771-2439-4b38-92bb-4ad570810798","ref":{"parent":"4eb3f28b-8e2f-4329-996e-597875a05436","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-17-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EThe Director of Public Works is authorized, upon application, to issue parking permits to residents of the permit parking zone for use of their bona fide transient guests.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 1197, (part), 1982)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"b1bc0771-2439-4b38-92bb-4ad570810798","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/437f9741-4086-49c8-bd83-db4f62240b5b","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-18","docId":"75","text":"11.27.070 Restrictions on Parking Permits.","id":"437f9741-4086-49c8-bd83-db4f62240b5b","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/437f9741-4086-49c8-bd83-db4f62240b5b\/f4349dfb-959e-44b4-9eb0-0aa32479f6f6","ref":{"parent":"437f9741-4086-49c8-bd83-db4f62240b5b","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-18-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EA parking permit shall not guarantee or reserve to the holder thereof an on-street parking space within the designated permit zone, nor shall permit holders be exempt from parking restrictions or prohibitions established pursuant to authority other than this chapter.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 1197, (part), 1982)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"f4349dfb-959e-44b4-9eb0-0aa32479f6f6","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/b9bf33e6-8e17-46da-9ccd-1da413bba27d","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-19","docId":"75","text":"11.27.080 Display of Permits.","id":"b9bf33e6-8e17-46da-9ccd-1da413bba27d","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/b9bf33e6-8e17-46da-9ccd-1da413bba27d\/042d1920-bb77-48d1-bba6-426ba0b89e06","ref":{"parent":"b9bf33e6-8e17-46da-9ccd-1da413bba27d","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-19-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Col class=\u0022default-style\u0022 style=\u0022list-style-type:upper-alpha\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPermits shall be issued in a sticker decal form and be permanently affixed to the left rear bumper of the motor vehicle. Trailers, motorcycles and vehicles without bumpers shall have permits permanently affixed to the left rear of the vehicle in a way they shall be easily seen and read by enforcement officers.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPermits of guests of residents of the parking permit zone and nonresident visitor permits shall be issued in a card form for display through the windshield of the vehicle in a way that they shall be easily seen and read by enforcement officers.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETrailers, motorcycles and vehicles without windshields or enclosed areas shall have permits attached to the vehicle in such a manner that they shall be easily seen and read by enforcement officers.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 1197, (part), 1982)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"042d1920-bb77-48d1-bba6-426ba0b89e06","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/a6fe6d91-18d9-40f0-8f61-f90b00431d54","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-210","docId":"75","text":"11.27.090 Permit Parking Exemptions.","id":"a6fe6d91-18d9-40f0-8f61-f90b00431d54","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/a6fe6d91-18d9-40f0-8f61-f90b00431d54\/29c71604-a7b7-4157-8269-4fdde15c9408","ref":{"parent":"a6fe6d91-18d9-40f0-8f61-f90b00431d54","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-210-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Col class=\u0022default-style\u0022 style=\u0022list-style-type:upper-alpha\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVehicles readily identifiable by enforcement officers as emergency or government will be exempted from the parking restrictions of this chapter.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVehicles readily identifiable as commercial, delivery, service and contractor\u2019s vehicles, while the occupants of the vehicles are actually engaged in providing services to residences or commercial enterprises, or in the maintenance and repair of public services or utilities, will be exempt from the parking restrictions of this chapter.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe Director of Public Works may grant upon request individual one-day exemptions for nonresidents attending scheduled community events conducted in the permit parking zone. Application for such exemptions shall be made in a time and manner to be determined by the Director of Public Works.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 1197, (part), 1982)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"29c71604-a7b7-4157-8269-4fdde15c9408","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/0f6d26d3-4e54-4c40-92f5-a0a0b531af03","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-211","docId":"75","text":"11.27.100 Application for Permit.","id":"0f6d26d3-4e54-4c40-92f5-a0a0b531af03","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/0f6d26d3-4e54-4c40-92f5-a0a0b531af03\/ba86b343-058a-4bf6-8aab-54645799f612","ref":{"parent":"0f6d26d3-4e54-4c40-92f5-a0a0b531af03","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-211-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EEach application or reapplication for an annual parking permit shall contain information sufficient to identify the applicant, his address within the permit zone, and the license number of the motor vehicle for which application is made and such other information that may be deemed relevant by the Director of Public Works.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 1197, (part), 1982)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"ba86b343-058a-4bf6-8aab-54645799f612","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/768384ee-17d5-463c-a658-fa2f6aed30c2","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-212","docId":"75","text":"11.27.110 Validity of Parking Permits.","id":"768384ee-17d5-463c-a658-fa2f6aed30c2","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/768384ee-17d5-463c-a658-fa2f6aed30c2\/89870011-9de6-449d-b540-5c3e1be4691a","ref":{"parent":"768384ee-17d5-463c-a658-fa2f6aed30c2","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-212-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Col class=\u0022default-style\u0022 style=\u0022list-style-type:upper-alpha\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe parking permit issued to each resident or guest of resident within the zone shall expire on January 2, 1984, and thereafter will expire on January 2nd of every even-numbered year.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPermits may be renewed biennially upon reapplication in the manner required by the Director of Public Works.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 1197, (part), 1982)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"89870011-9de6-449d-b540-5c3e1be4691a","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/a5467b3f-0972-4b52-8e8a-3466bfdd3e61","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-213","docId":"75","text":"11.27.120 Replacement of Permits.","id":"a5467b3f-0972-4b52-8e8a-3466bfdd3e61","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/a5467b3f-0972-4b52-8e8a-3466bfdd3e61\/e7fc55d3-1e3b-4d8a-aa45-34589cb82000","ref":{"parent":"a5467b3f-0972-4b52-8e8a-3466bfdd3e61","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-213-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Col class=\u0022default-style\u0022 style=\u0022list-style-type:upper-alpha\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe Director of Public Works may issue a duplicate permit if any resident to whom a valid parking permit has been issued, or to whom a valid guest of resident permit has been issued can furnish proof that the permit has been destroyed, lost, or the vehicle to which permit was affixed has been disposed of.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA new permit will be issued and the old permit will be canceled.\u003C\/li\u003E\u003C\/ol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 1197, (part), 1982)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"e7fc55d3-1e3b-4d8a-aa45-34589cb82000","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/7b2ca22a-0cd1-4b2a-974c-4aedb87b3f92","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-214","docId":"75","text":"11.27.130 Period of Restricted Parking.","id":"7b2ca22a-0cd1-4b2a-974c-4aedb87b3f92","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/7b2ca22a-0cd1-4b2a-974c-4aedb87b3f92\/ecb60a1c-b360-446c-b8ae-4e2ac111886e","ref":{"parent":"7b2ca22a-0cd1-4b2a-974c-4aedb87b3f92","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-214-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EThe date and time when parking restrictions will be in effect in the permit parking zone will be established by resolution of the City Council of the City.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 1197, (part), 1982)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"ecb60a1c-b360-446c-b8ae-4e2ac111886e","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/0de3bf7a-4fd9-467e-b2bb-fce56e479158","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-215","docId":"75","text":"11.27.140 Revocation of Permit.","id":"0de3bf7a-4fd9-467e-b2bb-fce56e479158","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/0de3bf7a-4fd9-467e-b2bb-fce56e479158\/f900056d-8419-43a3-b4bf-1b0783408f93","ref":{"parent":"0de3bf7a-4fd9-467e-b2bb-fce56e479158","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-215-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EThe Director of Public Works is authorized to revoke the parking permit of any person found to be in violation of this chapter, and upon written notification thereof, the person shall surrender such permit to the Director of Public Works. Failure, when so requested, to surrender a parking permit so revoked shall constitute a violation of this chapter.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E(Ord. 1197, (part), 1982)\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","id":"f900056d-8419-43a3-b4bf-1b0783408f93","prev_id":null}]},{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/af83ab98-c236-4d54-bfc9-bad89f273cc0","ref":{"parent":"f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"subsection","hasChildren":2,"tag":"h4"},"pos":"212-210-216","docId":"75","text":"11.27.145 Designation of Preferential Parking Zones.","id":"af83ab98-c236-4d54-bfc9-bad89f273cc0","children":[{"path":"\/ccb0cd02-0dd5-407b-bffd-162d19236255\/f40bcffd-181a-4ae9-8b03-473248efe7c5\/af83ab98-c236-4d54-bfc9-bad89f273cc0\/447e43d0-2b68-4153-aaa1-4cc092415b19","ref":{"parent":"af83ab98-c236-4d54-bfc9-bad89f273cc0","name":"subsection"},"li_attr":{"dataTag":"BodyM","hasChildren":0},"pos":"212-210-216-11","docId":"75","text":"\u003Cp\u003EThe following street areas are designated as preferential parking zones under this chapter:\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Ctable cellpadding=\u00220\u0022 cellspacing=\u00220\u0022 style=\u0022width:600px\u0022\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\u0022col\u0022 style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStreet\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\u0022col\u0022 style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELimits\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\u0022col\u0022 style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESpecial Hours\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/th\u003E\u003C\/tr\u003E\u003C\/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd style=\u0022vertical-align:top\u0022\u003EAnn Arbor Avenue\u